AdamW training resource accounting
Generated with Codex (GPT-5). Assume float32 for every tensor.

Algebraic setup
  B=batch_size, V=vocab_size, T=context_length, L=num_layers, D=d_model, H=num_heads, F=8D/3
  P                        2VD + L(4D^2 + 3DF + 2D) + D  # trainable parameters
  block_activations
    RMSNorms               2TD  # ln1 and ln2
    QKV projections        3TD  # Q, K, V
    QK^T scores            HT^2  # attention scores
    softmax                HT^2  # attention probabilities
    weighted values        TD  # attention output before W_O
    output projection      TD  # W_O output
    SwiGLU W1/W3           2TF  # two up-projection branches
    SiLU gate              TF  # activation on gate branch
    elementwise product    TF  # SwiGLU gated hidden
    SwiGLU W2              TD  # down-projection output
  block_activations        8TD + 4TF + 2HT^2  # simplified
  activations_per_batch_item
    transformer blocks     L * block_activations
    final RMSNorm          TD
    output logits          TV
    cross-entropy          TV
  activations_per_batch_item L*block_activations + TD + TV + TV
                           = L(8TD + 4TF + 2HT^2) + TD + 2TV  # simplified
  memory_params            4 * P bytes  # parameters
  memory_gradients         4 * P bytes  # gradients
  memory_optim_state       8 * P bytes  # AdamW m and v
  memory_activations       4 * B * activations_per_batch_item bytes  # saved activations
  total_peak_memory        16 * P + 4 * B * activations_per_batch_item bytes  # params + grads + state + activations

